  "measurementTechnique": "Logical consistency: Interlaboratory comparisons of nutrient and carbon-13 and oxygen-18 measurements; comparison to known standards. Salinometer calibrated with standard seawater. Fluorometer calibrated with commercially prepared standard or concentrated natural pigments.Nutrient standards compared to commercially prepared standards.\n\nCompleteness: Electronic Data Complications: All of the magnetic tapes are older then their guaranteed physical lifespan.\n\nProcessing step (Unknown): Unknown",
